+"""Tests for Exp 3785 capstone v346.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-REPORT-3785, SCENARIO-REPORT-3785,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-3785-P1-GUARD, SCENARIO-REPORT-3785-MISSING-BLOCKED,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-3785-FLAGGED.
